  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protecting Sumatran Orangutans by preventing forest encroachment and improving and strengthening law enforcement in Gunung Leuser National Park</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to protect orangutans by reducing forest encroachment and strengthening law enforcement in Gunung Leuser National Park. The project objectives are as follows: (1) Reduction of hunting, illegal logging, encroachment and other threats in key-habitat in Gunung Leuser National Park, (2) Halt the Sumatran orangutan trade, trafficking and possession. These objectives will be implemented over a 3-year timeframe in order to achieve sustained impact at protecting Orang-utans in the GLNP, through a sustained increase in patrolling (Objective 1) and identifying and reduction in orangutan trade (Objective 2).</narrative>
  </description>
